      "writtenOn": "2020-04-08T01:30:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if it is worth mentioning that Cr50 reboot and device reboot is not the same thing. \n\nCr50 never reboots unless the power (including battery) is disconnected or its firmware is updated. (or it crashes :P)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "85e06f9ada262b4e2e99405235bff7f9eee497a4",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
